    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The goal is to create a text-based Python program, executable from the command line, that manages the shop's inventory, sales, and profits. The project assesses the ability to translate specifications into code while adhering strictly to them, to select appropriate data structures, and to write clean, documented, and robust code.\n",
        "\n",
        "Before writing any code, consider which data structures to use (lists, tuples, dictionaries, or combinations such as lists of dictionaries) and how to organize the functionality into dedicated functions."
      ],
      "metadata": {
